{
	"Name": "Okta - Authentication & Sessions - Okta Password Spray from One Device",
	"Description": "Alert: Okta\nGroup: Authentication & Sessions\nMITRE ATT&CK: Credential Access / T1110.003\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Okta Password Spray from One Device\" or \"<ip>|Okta Password Spray from One Device\"\n\nOne device token hash (debugData.dtHash) with failed authentications (INVALID_CREDENTIALS) for three or more different users within the search window. Catches sprays that rotate IPs but reuse one browser/device.\n\nFalse positives: shared kiosk devices.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/credential_access_okta_authentication_for_multiple_users_with_the_same_device_token_hash/\n- https://github.com/elastic/detection-rules/blob/main/rules/integrations/okta/credential_access_okta_authentication_for_multiple_users_with_the_same_device_token_hash.toml",
	"GUID": "da8352ea-e420-5137-a414-ab12d8e28d17",
